cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "LogiSCAG: Operational-Validity Enforcement and Four-Pillar Evaluation for Synthetic Supply-Chain Data"
type: software
abstract: >-
  LogiSCAG is a generator-agnostic toolkit for enforcing and auditing
  operational-validity constraints in synthetic tabular supply-chain data.
  It provides a declarative constraint catalog, a rejection-sampling
  enforcement wrapper compatible with any fitted tabular synthesizer, and a
  leakage-safe four-pillar evaluation harness (integrity, fidelity, utility,
  privacy) with power-validated privacy auditing.
authors:
